{"ref":"BDB, חוּשַׁי","hw":"חוּשַׁי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חוּשַׁי</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳ הָאַרְכִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:32\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.32\">2 S 15:32</a> so <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:5\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.5\">17:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 17:14\" href=\"/II_Samuel.17.14\">14</a>, called <span dir=\"rtl\">רֵעֶה דוד</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 15:37\" href=\"/II_Samuel.15.37\">15:37</a> <em>friend of David</em>, so <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 16:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.16.16\">16:16</a> a; cf. <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 16:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.16.16\">16:16b</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 16:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.16.17\">17</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 16:18\" href=\"/II_Samuel.16.18\">18</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 27:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.27.33\">1 Ch 27:33</a>; also <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.6\">1 S 17:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:15\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.15\">15</a><br><strong>2.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"I Kings 4:16\" href=\"/I_Kings.4.16\">1 K 4:16</a> father of one of Solomon’s officers.","next":"BDB, חוּשִׁים","prev":"BDB, חֻשָׁתִי"}